# Sweep Along Path round a corner beside an arc: a rectangle swept along
# a line that meets a three-quarter arc at a right angle, joined where
# the profile's paths along the two cross, with no corner radius; the
# group screen, then the solid checked.
file $testdata/ui/sweep_arc_corner.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
click-entity 40000
click-entity 50000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
